# MASTER PROMPT — SECURE ONLINE EXAMINATION PORTAL

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Act as a **Senior Full-Stack Software Engineer, UI/UX Designer, Cybersecurity Specialist, AI Engineer, and System Architect**.

Build a complete, production-style, AI-powered web application named:

**SECURE ONLINE EXAMINATION PORTAL**

**Tagline:** "Smart Exams. Secure Environment. Intelligent Evaluation."

The application must provide a modern, secure, visually impressive online examination platform where students can register, verify their identity, take examinations, practice mock tests, and view performance reports.

Administrators must be able to register through an authorized process, create and manage examinations, monitor student activities, review suspected cheating incidents, evaluate performance, and generate detailed reports.

The project must include:

- Fully functional frontend and backend.
- Real database integration.
- Student and administrator authentication.
- Face verification and biometric login options.
- Email and mobile number verification.
- AI-powered examination proctoring.
- Webcam, microphone, and screen-sharing monitoring.
- Head posture and eye-gaze tracking.
- Automated violation warnings.
- Automatic examination submission.
- AI chatbot for students and administrators.
- Interactive 3D animated login and registration pages.
- Beautiful, animated student and administrator dashboards.
- Timed examinations and mock test sessions.
- Examination reports, marks, analytics, and performance tracking.
- Automatic session logout after five minutes of inactivity.

**IMPORTANT:** Do not create a static UI, nonfunctional buttons, fake reports, or dummy authentication. Implement real workflows, backend APIs, persistent database storage, server-side validation, and working navigation.

