**Check 7: Examination Rules**

Display rules and obtain acknowledgment.

Present each check with an animated status indicator.

Only enable **Start Secure Examination** when mandatory checks are completed.

Do not bypass denied permissions or pretend browser APIs can capture information that the operating system does not allow.

